name: plan
description: Structured planning for non-trivial {{PROJECT_NAME}} tickets: loads the relevant harness docs, then produces a step plan with files to touch, reuse targets, and risks. Use before implementing anything estimated over ~an hour or touching more than ~3 files.
user_invocable: true
